Error [jet.NotSerializable]: `TaskID` can't be serialized
  --> tests/ui/http_server_json_distinct_not_encodable.jet:8:25
    |
  8 |     _: server.json(200, id)
    |                         ^^
 Why: Only types that opt in (and their fields) have a wire form; `TaskID` does not
 Fix: Add `#CodableAsBase` to `TaskID` so it is encoded as its base type, or remove it from the encoded value
